#: ../../source/users/element/type/previous_reference_folio.rst:5
msgid "Previous reference folio"
msgstr "上一个参考文件"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/previous_reference_folio.rst:7
msgid ""
"Element which link the beginning of a `conductor`_ with the end of the "
"`conductor`_ represented at previous, following or same `folio`_."
msgstr ""
"连接开始的元素 `导体 <conductor_>`_ 结尾 `导体 <conductor_>`_ 上届、下届或下届 `图幅 <folio_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/previous_reference_folio.rst:13
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech previous reference folio"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 前一个参考文件"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/previous_reference_folio.rst:15
msgid ""
"For previous referencing folio element exist two type of variables, the "
"general variables that are common for all type of `elements`_ and the "
"specific variables for this type of `element`_."
msgstr ""
"对于先前的参考folio元素存在两种类型的变量，即所有类型 `元件 <elements_>`_ 通用的一般变量，以及这类 `元件 "
"<element_>`_ 的特定变量。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/previous_reference_folio.rst:18
msgid ""
"QElectroTech does not allow defining variable values for this type of "
"`element`_. QElectroTech does also not allows defining new variables. "
"QElectroTech allows only displaying the specific variables at `dynamic "
"texts`_."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech不允许定义该类型 `元件 <element_>`_ "
"的变量值。QEctroTech也不允许定义新的变量。QEctroTech只允许在 `动态文本 <dynamic texts_>`_ 上显示特定的变量。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/previous_reference_folio.rst:22
msgid "General variables"
msgstr "一般变量"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/previous_reference_folio.rst:24
msgid "**% {F}**: Label from the `folio`_ where the `element`_ can be found."
msgstr "**% {F} (韩语)** 标签 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 地点 `元件 <element_>`_ 可见。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/previous_reference_folio.rst:25
msgid "**% {f}**: Number from the `folio`_ where the `element`_ can be found."
msgstr "**% {f} (韩语)** 编号： `图幅 <folio_>`_ 地点 `元件 <element_>`_ 可见。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/previous_reference_folio.rst:26
msgid ""
"**% {M}**: Plant variable from the `folio`_ where the `element`_ can be "
"found."
msgstr "**% {M}**:可以找到 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 的 `元件 <element_>`_ 的植物变量。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/previous_reference_folio.rst:27
msgid ""
"**% {LM}**: Location variable of the `folio`_ where the `element`_ can be "
"found."
msgstr "**% {LM}**:可以找到 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 的 `元件 <element_>`_ 的位置变量。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/previous_reference_folio.rst:28
msgid ""
"**% {l}**: Folio line number from the `workspace`_ where the `element`_ can "
"be found."
msgstr "**% {l}**:可以找到 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 的 `元件 <element_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/previous_reference_folio.rst:29
msgid ""
"**% {c}**: Folio column number from the `workspace`_ where the `element`_ "
"can be found."
msgstr "**% {c}**:可以找到 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 的 `元件 <element_>`_ 的Folio列号。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/previous_reference_folio.rst:30
msgid "**% {id}**: Folio position in the `project`_ (Schema number)."
msgstr "**% {id}**: `项目 <project_>`_ 中的Folio位置(计划编号)."

#: ../../source/users/element/type/previous_reference_folio.rst:32
msgid "Specific variables"
msgstr "具体变量"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/previous_reference_folio.rst:34
msgid ""
"**Function**: Function property from the `conductor`_ connected to the "
"`element terminal`_."
msgstr "**函数**: 来自 `导体 <conductor_>`_ 连接到 `元素终端 <element terminal_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/previous_reference_folio.rst:35
msgid ""
"**Label**: Internal variable which defines the position of the linked "
"`reference folio following`_ element."
msgstr "**标签**:定义链接 `的内在变量在 <reference folio following_>`_ 元素之后的引用框位置。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/previous_reference_folio.rst:36
msgid ""
"**Voltage/Protocol**: Voltage/Protocol property from the `conductor`_ "
"connected to the `element terminal`_."
msgstr ""
"**Voltage/Protocol**:电压/Protocol属性来自 `导体 <conductor_>`_ 连接 `元素终端 <element "
"terminal_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/previous_reference_folio.rst:40
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The **Label** property can be defined as a formula by the user at `New "
"folio`_ section from `project properties`_. By default the formula is "
"``%id-%l%c``, variables took from `reference folio following`_ linked "
"element."
msgstr ""
"那个 **标签** 属性可以定义为用户在 `新组合 <New folio_>`_ 区域 `项目属性 <project "
"properties_>`_。默认情况下，公式是 ``%id-%l%c``,变量从 `以下引用框 <reference folio "
"following_>`_ 链接元素。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/previous_reference_folio.rst:44
msgid ""
"For more information about how to define the **Label** formula, please "
"refers to `folio referencing project properties`_."
msgstr ""
"关于如何定义 **Label** 公式的更多信息，请参考 `folio参考项目属性 <folio referencing project "
"properties_>`_。"
